    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m not sure what you mean. Perhaps what you&#39;re looking for is to use an iframe tag to include a shiny app (or any webpage) within your shiny app? I&#39;m not sure what you mean by creating output that should be used for another app - more details would help</div>"
